chains:
Let \(A\) be Andrew's current age. Andrew's grandfather is \(12A\) years old. The difference between his ages is the same as the time since Andrew was born. Therefore,

\begin{align*}
12A - A &= 55 \\
11A &= 55 \\
A &= 5
\end{align*}

Thus, Andrew is 5 years old now.

\boxed{5}

